title: The Corridors
subtitle: Most votes are won outside the hall.
view-if: congress = 1 and congress_closing = 0
on-arrival: {!
Q.month_actions += 1;
Q.sys_outcome = 0;
!}
frequency: 100
is-card: true
new-page: true
tags: congress

= The Corridors

In the corridors, the cloakroom and the beer hall next door, the delegates are doing what delegates do: counting each other. Our whips have a list of names with a question mark beside them.

- @travel: Pay the fares of the poorer delegations.
- @rumours: Spread what we know about the opposition's leaders.
- @dinner: Dine with the waverers.

@travel
subtitle: Costs 1 fund. More delegates from the districts that trust us.
choose-if: resources >= 1
unavailable-subtitle: We have no funds.
on-arrival: {!
Q.resources -= 1;
var moved = 0;
for (var d of Q.districts) {
    if (Q['district_' + d + '_loyalty'] >= 50) {
        moved += RG.congress.convert(d, 0.15);
    }
}
RG.congress.tally();
Q.congress_last_moved = moved;
!}

Delegates who could not afford the train arrive on the night express, with their fares paid by the Zentrale. [? if congress_last_moved > 0 : [+ congress_last_moved +] more votes for us. ?][? if congress_last_moved = 0 : They are welcome, though they do not change much. ?]

@rumours
subtitle: Works on some delegates and disgusts others.
on-arrival: {!
RG.congress.sway(0.05);
RG.congress.bitter(4);
if (Math.random() < 0.3) {
    Q.sys_outcome = 2;
    RG.congress.lose(0.03);
} else {
    Q.sys_outcome = 1;
}
!}

Stories go round about who drank with whom in 1918, and who signed what for the police. [? if sys_outcome = 1 : [+ congress_last_moved +] delegates decide they cannot vote for such people. ?][? if sys_outcome = 2 : One of the stories turns out to be false, and everyone knows who spread it. ?]

@dinner
subtitle: A few votes, safely.
on-arrival: {!
RG.congress.sway(0.025);
Q.unity += 1;
!}

Over sausages and beer, the waverers explain their doubts and we listen. [? if congress_last_moved > 0 : [+ congress_last_moved +] of them leave the table on our side. ?][? if congress_last_moved = 0 : They enjoy the dinner. ?]
